    "This is a separate app device, not a model-provider login. The Gateway is loopback only. Enter its bootstrap token/password privately here; never put it in chat. Only Yorozu's own device token and generated key are saved in Keychain. A new device approval may be required. Leave blank to reconnect an enrolled device." : {
